# Last Updated Date

When changing Events or Beauty content, also update the visible `Last updated` date in `src/components/Hero.tsx` to today's date.

This applies to changes that affect event listings, event parsing/filtering, bundled event data, Beauty tab content, or copy that users see in those sections.

Use the format already shown in the component, for example:

```tsx
<p className="last-updated">Last updated · May 13, 2026</p>
```
